WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:01.312
- Good morning, Believe Nation.

00:00:01.312 --> 00:00:02.145
It's Evan.

00:00:02.145 --> 00:00:03.583
My one word is believe

00:00:03.583 --> 00:00:06.427
and I believe in people more
than they believe in themselves

00:00:06.427 --> 00:00:09.115
and my sincere hope is
that if you see in yourself

00:00:09.115 --> 00:00:12.534
what I see in you, you'll be
able to change the planet.

00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:13.884
So to help you on your journey,

00:00:13.884 --> 00:00:17.056
today's message is we are all stars.

00:00:17.056 --> 00:00:18.655
Over to you, Beyonce.

00:00:18.655 --> 00:00:21.215
(rooster crowing)

00:00:21.215 --> 00:00:23.755
♫ I wake up every mornin'

00:00:23.755 --> 00:00:26.454
♫ Entspresso keep me goin'

00:00:26.454 --> 00:00:30.524
♫ I wake up every mornin'

00:00:30.524 --> 00:00:34.191
- I think a star is
born a star, absolutely.

00:00:35.136 --> 00:00:39.053
I think, I know me, I
was born to do what I do.

00:00:41.704 --> 00:00:43.916
It's just too natural.

00:00:43.916 --> 00:00:46.685
There's certain things that
I know, no one taught me.

00:00:46.685 --> 00:00:48.707
No one can teach you.

00:00:48.707 --> 00:00:50.904
It's just you are.

00:00:50.904 --> 00:00:55.071
And I feel like we all are
stars, we all have that.

00:00:56.875 --> 00:00:59.823
We just have to figure
out what that thing is

00:00:59.823 --> 00:01:01.354
that we're supposed to be doing in life.

00:01:01.354 --> 00:01:04.425
And I know that for me to know exactly

00:01:04.425 --> 00:01:06.813
what I was born to do at such a young age

00:01:06.813 --> 00:01:09.980
is why I've been able to do what I do,

00:01:12.412 --> 00:01:13.972
as well as I do it,

00:01:13.972 --> 00:01:17.101
because I've been doing
it for a really long time

00:01:17.101 --> 00:01:18.993
and I'm doing the right thing.

00:01:18.993 --> 00:01:21.108
So I'm very lucky.

00:01:21.108 --> 00:01:23.021
- So I believe that everybody has Beyonce,

00:01:23.021 --> 00:01:25.310
or what I like to call
Michael Jordan level talent,

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:26.193
at something.

00:01:26.193 --> 00:01:29.273
You have Beyonce level
talent at something.

00:01:29.273 --> 00:01:31.328
You just may not have discovered it yet

00:01:31.328 --> 00:01:32.711
and if you have discovered it,

00:01:32.711 --> 00:01:34.349
you may not be good enough at it yet

00:01:34.349 --> 00:01:35.191
and you need to practice

00:01:35.191 --> 00:01:37.309
and hone in your skills
and put in the work.

00:01:37.309 --> 00:01:39.478
And what I would really
encourage you to do

00:01:39.478 --> 00:01:42.320
is look at the work that
you're working at right now,

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:43.777
does it make you happy?

00:01:43.777 --> 00:01:46.061
Are you fulfilled in the
work that you're doing?

00:01:46.061 --> 00:01:48.069
You may not be happy with the results.

00:01:48.069 --> 00:01:50.511
You may not be happy because
you're a perfectionist

00:01:50.511 --> 00:01:52.203
and because you know you
can always be better.

00:01:52.203 --> 00:01:54.470
You may not be happy because
you're not earning the income

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:55.912
that you want to be earning yet.

00:01:55.912 --> 00:01:58.950
You may not be happy because
you're not getting the awards

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:01.183
or the accolades from people yet.

00:02:01.183 --> 00:02:03.792
But are you happy with the actual work?

00:02:03.792 --> 00:02:05.439
Are you happy with the progress?

00:02:05.439 --> 00:02:07.935
Because at the start of
anything, you're going to suck.

00:02:07.935 --> 00:02:10.801
You know, the start of me
making my YouTube channel,

00:02:10.801 --> 00:02:12.073
I sucked.

00:02:12.073 --> 00:02:14.302
I enjoyed making the videos.

00:02:14.302 --> 00:02:15.670
I enjoyed the process.

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:17.701
I enjoyed getting in front of the camera

00:02:17.701 --> 00:02:19.371
and talking to you guys.

00:02:19.371 --> 00:02:23.280
But I sucked, my delivery
sucked, my editing sucked.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:26.202
You know, my SCO and
titles, all of that sucked.

00:02:26.202 --> 00:02:27.143
I had no comments.

00:02:27.143 --> 00:02:28.963
From an external perspective, you're like,

00:02:28.963 --> 00:02:33.712
no comments, no views, no
awards, very minimal growth.

00:02:33.712 --> 00:02:35.653
But I was happy doing what I was doing

00:02:35.653 --> 00:02:37.342
and I wanted to get better at it.

00:02:37.342 --> 00:02:38.861
And so, for me, that's the key.

00:02:38.861 --> 00:02:41.882
Because you can quickly surpass people

00:02:41.882 --> 00:02:45.443
who have years of experience in any field

00:02:45.443 --> 00:02:47.652
if you are deeply passionate about it.

00:02:47.652 --> 00:02:49.741
The person who has the
passion, the excitement,

00:02:49.741 --> 00:02:52.470
and the enjoyment for the work,
enjoyment for the process,

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:54.481
will quickly destroy the person

00:02:54.481 --> 00:02:56.194
who doesn't really have the enjoyment

00:02:56.194 --> 00:02:57.773
but has the years of experience.

00:02:57.773 --> 00:02:59.433
You can learn anything really quickly.

00:02:59.433 --> 00:03:02.223
Think about anything that
you've learned recently.

00:03:02.223 --> 00:03:04.414
You could pick it up super fast

00:03:04.414 --> 00:03:07.966
if you're motivated to do it,
if it doesn't feel like work.

00:03:07.966 --> 00:03:09.995
You can learn anything,
whether it's a language,

00:03:09.995 --> 00:03:12.742
whether it's a skill, whether
it's how to market yourself.

00:03:12.742 --> 00:03:15.225
If you wanted to learn YouTube marketing,

00:03:15.225 --> 00:03:17.594
if you wanted to understand
the YouTube algorithm,

00:03:17.594 --> 00:03:19.534
you could pick that up really quickly.

00:03:19.534 --> 00:03:21.759
You know, within a day,
you could know more

00:03:21.759 --> 00:03:24.336
than 99% of the YouTubers out there,

00:03:24.336 --> 00:03:26.005
just by doing research.

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:28.737
And so, I wouldn't get so caught up

00:03:28.737 --> 00:03:30.565
in a lot of industries about, you know,

00:03:30.565 --> 00:03:33.292
the experience level, 'cause
you can get there faster

00:03:33.292 --> 00:03:35.801
if you have that deep,
dedicated passion to it.

00:03:35.801 --> 00:03:38.111
But that's the thing, are
you happy with the work?

00:03:38.111 --> 00:03:40.044
And sometimes that's hard to separate.

00:03:40.044 --> 00:03:42.844
Sometimes it's hard to see
something that you are excited by

00:03:42.844 --> 00:03:45.622
and you love doing and you're
not seeing the results,

00:03:45.622 --> 00:03:47.676
and you just keep on doing it.

00:03:47.676 --> 00:03:52.045
For me, to make 5,000 videos,
to keep on making the content,

00:03:52.045 --> 00:03:53.812
even though you're not seeing the results.

00:03:53.812 --> 00:03:55.921
And that's why the single
most important lesson

00:03:55.921 --> 00:03:57.595
that comes from all of these videos,

00:03:57.595 --> 00:03:59.313
all of these people that I've researched,

00:03:59.313 --> 00:04:02.724
is to follow your passion, the
thing that you're excited by.

00:04:02.724 --> 00:04:05.174
Because if you don't,
you're going to quit.

00:04:05.174 --> 00:04:06.698
You're going to quit 'cause it's too hard,

00:04:06.698 --> 00:04:07.759
'cause there's lots of competition,

00:04:07.759 --> 00:04:08.909
there's lots of people doing it.

00:04:08.909 --> 00:04:10.310
It's just too hard to break through

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.730
in a lot of these industries

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:14.098
unless you are super passionate
with what you're doing.

00:04:14.098 --> 00:04:17.741
And so you have Beyonce
level talent at something.

00:04:17.741 --> 00:04:20.080
Maybe you've discovered
it and if you have,

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:22.190
then you just need to
continue to work at it,

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:23.499
even if you aren't seeing the results,

00:04:23.499 --> 00:04:25.038
to work at it every day, work at it.

00:04:25.038 --> 00:04:27.029
Stop putting it off 'til tomorrow.

00:04:27.029 --> 00:04:29.151
Stop quitting, stop starting and stopping,

00:04:29.151 --> 00:04:30.152
starting and stopping.

00:04:30.152 --> 00:04:32.079
Every day you have to
work on it to get better,

00:04:32.079 --> 00:04:35.149
because Beyonce had the talent
but she put in the work.

00:04:35.149 --> 00:04:35.982
Right?

00:04:35.982 --> 00:04:37.190
That's what you need to do.

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:39.340
What if Beyonce had never
discovered her singing, though?

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.556
What if Beyonce had never
discovered her dancing?

00:04:41.556 --> 00:04:45.291
She would be, you know,
working at some job at Costco,

00:04:45.291 --> 00:04:47.329
or Starbucks, or McDonald's, or some job

00:04:47.329 --> 00:04:51.160
that was not to her level of stardom.

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.501
That's what most people do.

00:04:52.501 --> 00:04:55.871
Most people are in a job,
or even starting a business,

00:04:55.871 --> 00:04:58.989
that is below their capabilities,

00:04:58.989 --> 00:05:00.901
where you could be a star at something

00:05:00.901 --> 00:05:04.181
and instead you're playing
way, way, way below

00:05:04.181 --> 00:05:05.760
what your capable of doing.

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:06.920
And so if she had never discovered

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:09.296
her singing or her dancing,

00:05:09.296 --> 00:05:11.129
how much worse off would she be?

00:05:11.129 --> 00:05:13.599
But how much worse off would we all be?

00:05:13.599 --> 00:05:15.667
Right, like her music, her dancing

00:05:15.667 --> 00:05:17.198
has been a gift to all of us.

00:05:17.198 --> 00:05:19.960
How many of you have been
inspired by a Beyonce song

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.385
that moved you, that was there for you

00:05:22.385 --> 00:05:23.680
when you needed tough times,

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:26.867
or that motivated you to go
off and do something great.

00:05:26.867 --> 00:05:28.588
I have a couple of her
songs on my playlist

00:05:28.588 --> 00:05:30.356
that I love when they come on.

00:05:30.356 --> 00:05:32.577
And so, you're doing a
disservice to yourself

00:05:32.577 --> 00:05:35.615
and to your community and
to the world at whole,

00:05:35.615 --> 00:05:37.580
if you are not going in on the things

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:38.839
that you could be a star at

00:05:38.839 --> 00:05:41.579
